# Repo-wide environment template. Copy to .env only if you need to override something;
# every value below has a working default and the repo runs with no .env at all.
#
# The API's own settings are NOT read from this file. `app/config.py` loads
# `apps/mock-api/.env` (prefix APP_), so copy `apps/mock-api/.env.example` there instead.

# --- Ports (fixed in config, not read from the environment) -------------------
# Listed so the numbers are documented in one place; change them in the files named.
#   8000  mock-api            package.json -> start:api (uvicorn --port)
#   4200  portal-angular dev  apps/portal-angular/angular.json -> serve.options.port
#   8080  demo server         package.json -> demo:serve (uvicorn --port)
# The frontend proxies /api to http://localhost:8000, so the API must be running.

# --- Angular unit tests (Karma) ----------------------------------------------
# karma.conf.js resolves a Chrome binary from the puppeteer cache. Set CHROME_BIN to
# point at your own Chrome/Chromium, or PUPPETEER_CACHE_DIR if the cache is not in ~/.cache.
# CHROME_BIN=/usr/bin/chromium
# PUPPETEER_CACHE_DIR=/home/you/.cache/puppeteer
